[gd_scene load_steps=11 format=3]

; Catalog-only hanging planter with a shallow painted bowl and radial fern
; crown. Twenty-five selectable seven-frond fans overlap in upright, arching
; and trailing tiers, so the mature plant reads as a dense whole while every
; constituent course remains editable. The root origin is its ceiling attachment.

